# Overture: what a first visit performs. Inside twenty seconds it has to
# prove, without saying so, that this is not a text box: a drawing that draws
# itself, real pixels, a staged scene with depth and a camera, and a sketch
# that a painting would grow over. Words only where words are best.

scene hello caption calm
line ground 18,72 142,72 stroke=dim
rect wall 62,50 30x22
poly roof 57,50 77,33 97,50
rect door 73,60 8x12 fill=accent
circle sun 126,22 8 stroke=accent thick=1.2
say face=hand size=l | Hello.
pix cat at=36,62 scale=2 loop=bob
| .0......0.
| 090....090
| 0990000990
| 0999999990
| 0907997090
| 0999ee9990
| 0997997990
| .09999990.
| ..000000..
wait 3

color sky=#0b1026 dusk=#1c2a52 far=#18223f near=#24325a lit=#ffcf70 wall=#0e1730
scene night caption calm slow
look night
rect full layer=far fill=sky>dusk
ambient stars light
circle moon 128,20 9 layer=far fill=#f6f1d5
path layer=bg fill=far stroke=none | M0 60 Q40 40 82 56 T160 48 V90 H0 Z
path hill fill=near stroke=none | M0 74 Q52 58 100 72 T160 66 V90 H0 Z
group house at=132,56
rect in=house 0,0 16x12 fill=wall
poly in=house -2,0 8,-9 18,0 fill=wall
rect in=house 6,4 4x5 fill=lit
cam push slow
say | Evening comes.
ambient fireflies light layer=fg
wait 2
paint as=gouache | a small house on rolling blue hills under a huge pale moon, one window lit, stars
wait 5

cam rest
plan lines=5
say strong | What shall we make?
say choice | explain something with a drawing
say choice | pixel art
say choice | a story, staged
say choice | just the facts, plainly
